WEBVTT

00:06.770 --> 00:08.800
Liliel hasn't come out yet?

00:08.800 --> 00:10.450
Did something happen?

00:10.450 --> 00:11.780
Lilysa...!

00:20.490 --> 00:22.000
Liliel?

00:45.360 --> 00:52.450
2.5 DIMENSIONAL SEDUCTION

01:52.010 --> 01:57.010
#5 THE EVENT CONCLUDED!!

02:20.430 --> 02:22.150
Master Ashford!

02:27.600 --> 02:30.060
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

02:30.060 --> 02:31.010
Liliel...

02:31.790 --> 02:32.980
Thank goodness.

02:32.980 --> 02:34.550
Where'd that cute girl come from?!

02:34.550 --> 02:35.260
Who is she?

02:35.260 --> 02:36.720
A famous girl, of course!

02:36.720 --> 02:37.830
But I don't know her.

02:37.830 --> 02:39.930
How could I miss her
in this tiny venue?!

02:39.930 --> 02:42.410
Did she just change her costume now?

02:42.410 --> 02:43.890
There's only 10 minutes left!

02:44.860 --> 02:47.650
That is Liliel's True Angel form!

02:49.040 --> 02:52.370
When I heard of Liliel, I didn't pay
attention to her as an old character,

02:52.370 --> 02:53.980
but what is it?!

02:53.980 --> 02:58.120
This complicated feeling made me feel
as if I were reunited with my first crush!

02:58.490 --> 03:01.230
Every boy goes through
a Liliel phase once.

03:01.230 --> 03:04.460
Back in those days, I didn't know
what the word "otaku" meant.

03:05.140 --> 03:09.840
Back then, I was in love with Liliel!
I mean, the quality is so high!

03:09.960 --> 03:14.420
I-I can't let
Lady Magino know how I feel!

03:14.810 --> 03:15.930
Liliel?!

03:15.930 --> 03:17.390
Is she the girl from earlier?!

03:17.390 --> 03:19.730
Lil' bro, we've got to stay longer.

03:19.730 --> 03:21.970
You don't have to tell me, big bro.

03:22.540 --> 03:24.910
So how do you want to
run your photo shoot?

03:24.910 --> 03:26.940
I-It's my first time...

03:27.370 --> 03:31.980
I'd kind of like it if you'd be the one
to take my photo first.

03:31.980 --> 03:33.530
But we must find the place first.

03:33.530 --> 03:35.780
- Can I take your photo?!
- Can I have your business card?!

03:35.780 --> 03:37.990
- Your social media?!
- Are you selling any cosroms?

03:37.990 --> 03:40.070
Umm...

03:40.460 --> 03:43.680
Ogino, don't you want
to take Liliel's photo?

03:44.650 --> 03:49.370
What are you saying?!
I would never cheat on you!

03:49.370 --> 03:50.540
Blood tears?!

03:54.260 --> 03:56.050
WAAH WAAH
I want you to take her picture for me!

03:56.050 --> 03:57.990
WAAH WAAH
With your camera and your skills!

03:57.990 --> 03:58.940
CHATTER CHATTER
Just go ahead and do it!

03:58.940 --> 04:00.300
CHATTER CHATTER
Ouch!

04:00.300 --> 04:02.650
Are you starting your photo shoot?
I'd love to take it!

04:02.650 --> 04:03.250
Y-Yes!

04:03.250 --> 04:04.320
Are we making a line?

04:04.320 --> 04:06.080
But we don't have much time!

04:06.080 --> 04:06.540
Eeeh...

04:06.540 --> 04:08.390
But it's up to the cosplayer to decide.

04:08.390 --> 04:10.030
- What a mess.
- L-Liliel...!

04:10.030 --> 04:11.140
- The event's almost over.
- L-Liliel...!

04:11.140 --> 04:12.610
And she doesn't have an assistant.

04:13.040 --> 04:14.070
Alright, everyone!

04:14.070 --> 04:17.050
Liliel's photo ops will commence!

04:17.050 --> 04:17.710
Ah!

04:17.710 --> 04:20.190
This is her first event,
so please go easy on her!

04:20.190 --> 04:21.710
Her first?!

04:21.950 --> 04:24.210
May we use this area?

04:24.210 --> 04:24.770
Sure.

04:24.770 --> 04:26.090
Thank you very much!

04:26.090 --> 04:28.960
Then we will start shooting!

04:28.960 --> 04:32.670
We don't have much time,
so please form a semicircle!

04:35.020 --> 04:37.770
Ah... T-Thank you for your help.

04:38.140 --> 04:39.630
You're welcome.

04:39.630 --> 04:42.140
Getting the best spot
is more than enough.

04:42.140 --> 04:43.850
So he wants a photo too.

04:43.850 --> 04:46.490
Ready when you are!

04:47.180 --> 04:49.680
N-Nice to meet you all!

04:54.660 --> 04:57.410
It looks like an apology conference!

04:57.410 --> 04:58.750
Liliel!

04:59.460 --> 05:01.490
I-I have to pose!

05:12.330 --> 05:14.110
I can't get closer!

05:14.110 --> 05:16.180
Look at this crowd.

05:16.180 --> 05:17.270
Please look over here!

05:17.270 --> 05:18.100
Huh?!

05:18.100 --> 05:19.350
Over here!

05:19.350 --> 05:22.200
Eh? Where should I look?

05:22.830 --> 05:24.130
Watch out!

05:24.130 --> 05:24.890
Lilysa!

05:28.100 --> 05:30.060
S-Sorry about that...

05:30.060 --> 05:31.680
Thank goodness.

05:31.680 --> 05:33.520
She's really a beginner.

05:33.520 --> 05:35.980
And she can't even pose.

05:35.980 --> 05:37.590
We just want the standard.

05:37.590 --> 05:39.860
She doesn't know
how to deliver the service.

05:39.860 --> 05:43.140
No, I have a feeling that she's not
used to being photographed!

05:43.140 --> 05:43.940
Eh?

05:44.320 --> 05:48.300
W-What a silly thing to say!

05:48.300 --> 05:49.810
Don't you notice that?!

05:52.380 --> 05:56.250
Those are all the very poses
of Liliel that appear in the manga!

05:56.790 --> 05:59.310
And she isn't sticking
to the frontispiece poses,

05:59.310 --> 06:01.470
but also the casual poses!

06:01.930 --> 06:05.720
A new pose every five seconds.
She remembered it all!

06:05.720 --> 06:08.970
She is truly a real Liliel otaku!

06:09.930 --> 06:11.060
How is it going, Ogino?

06:11.450 --> 06:15.910
Eh? Ah! She's nothing compared to you!

06:15.910 --> 06:17.060
B-But...

06:17.510 --> 06:20.240
I think I have to give her my respect!

06:20.240 --> 06:21.690
She's so cute, right?

06:22.280 --> 06:25.870
So, how's your opinion
as a self-proclaimed cosplay critic, big bro?

06:26.620 --> 06:29.660
It's so hard to take her picture
because of this crowd.

06:29.660 --> 06:31.200
Well, yeah.

06:31.670 --> 06:34.350
But... She doesn't just cosplay it.

06:36.380 --> 06:39.760
That's an unusual impression.
What do you mean?

06:40.390 --> 06:42.340
I can't quite put it into words, but...

06:42.340 --> 06:44.940
It doesn't feel like cosplay.

06:44.940 --> 06:48.720
She's not a pro, but rather there's
something raw and natural about her.

06:48.720 --> 06:51.390
As if she's just being herself.

06:51.390 --> 06:55.120
It's like if the real Liliel came out
of the manga and was photographed

06:55.120 --> 06:57.540
with a camera.

06:59.410 --> 07:00.820
Big bro...

07:01.280 --> 07:04.150
So that means she's a real deal.

07:05.130 --> 07:07.460
I wonder what they think.

07:07.950 --> 07:11.490
Does my love for Liliel
really convey to them?

07:11.900 --> 07:14.250
For me, I really...

07:14.830 --> 07:16.450
...love Liliel.

07:18.690 --> 07:21.730
Take as many pictures as you can.
This girl is going to be famous.

07:22.860 --> 07:25.170
One minute left!

07:25.170 --> 07:27.520
What?!

07:29.100 --> 07:30.510
Lilysa...

07:30.510 --> 07:33.290
You're a girl!
Why are you reading these manga?

07:33.290 --> 07:35.270
I'm sorry, Mama, but...

07:35.270 --> 07:37.260
There must be something wrong with you!

07:37.260 --> 07:37.980
Huh?

07:39.780 --> 07:41.320
"Wrong"?

07:51.690 --> 07:52.450
This is...

07:53.050 --> 07:55.810
This is my first time
in public as Liliel!

07:55.810 --> 07:56.870
10 seconds!

07:57.990 --> 07:59.080
Nine!

07:59.080 --> 08:00.340
- Eight!
- Please look over here!

08:00.340 --> 08:01.290
- Seven!
- Over here!

08:01.970 --> 08:05.050
As otaku, we don't deny
talking about what we like!

08:05.470 --> 08:08.840
Your Liliel is the most
beautiful cosplay in the world!

08:09.610 --> 08:11.050
This is all thanks to Senior.

08:12.300 --> 08:14.420
He gave me the courage.

08:14.420 --> 08:15.270
Three!

08:15.830 --> 08:18.790
Two! One!

08:36.580 --> 08:38.580
Thank you very much!

08:38.580 --> 08:40.480
That last look was breathtaking!

08:40.480 --> 08:43.110
The best pose ever!

08:43.110 --> 08:46.170
Those eyes were filled with
love for Ashford!

08:46.170 --> 08:48.590
Why couldn't she have been looking at me?!

08:52.800 --> 08:54.270
Sorry, Liliel.

08:54.270 --> 08:55.390
Ah, Senior.

08:55.980 --> 08:58.600
I couldn't get your picture in shutter mode.

08:58.980 --> 09:00.670
I need just one photo to commemorate.

09:00.670 --> 09:01.810
Of course!

09:05.780 --> 09:08.810
I feel relieved that I lost
my cosplaying face.

09:09.700 --> 09:10.810
I'll take your picture.

09:13.660 --> 09:14.980
Senior, no!

09:14.980 --> 09:15.490
Huh?

09:15.490 --> 09:16.950
I wasn't ready!

09:16.950 --> 09:20.700
That wasn't my Liliel face!

09:24.070 --> 09:25.210
No.

09:26.070 --> 09:28.720
It's a good picture, Lilysa.

09:32.530 --> 09:34.720
Thank you, everyone!

09:34.720 --> 09:36.560
Thanks!

09:37.070 --> 09:39.990
Harucos 19 is officially closed.

09:39.990 --> 09:43.560
Please note that the changing room
will be available

09:43.560 --> 09:45.020
WOMEN'S CHANGING ROOM
until 5:00 p.m.

09:45.500 --> 09:46.390
Liliel!

09:46.390 --> 09:47.730
Huh? Y-Yes?

09:48.070 --> 09:48.660
Honorifics?

09:48.660 --> 09:49.850
I want your cosrom!

09:49.850 --> 09:50.980
Can I purchase it online?!

09:50.980 --> 09:52.990
S-Sorry. I'm still not...

09:52.990 --> 09:54.910
Can we share today's photos on social media?!

09:54.910 --> 09:56.450
I'm sorry, I'm still embarrassed...

09:56.450 --> 09:57.620
Your business card, please!

09:57.620 --> 09:59.410
Don't you have a social media account?!

09:59.410 --> 10:00.870
- I don't have any of that...
- Liliel!

10:00.870 --> 10:02.540
WOMEN'S CHANGING ROOM
- The changing room is closing!

10:02.540 --> 10:04.210
MEN'S CHANGING ROOM
Ah, I'm coming!

10:07.460 --> 10:10.220
I'm sorry everyone.
I have to go.

10:11.130 --> 10:13.830
No business cards
or social media accounts?

10:13.830 --> 10:16.160
Who the hell is she?

10:16.160 --> 10:17.280
A fairy?

10:17.280 --> 10:19.100
No, she's an angel.

10:19.100 --> 10:21.420
Cheese!

10:21.420 --> 10:23.440
We're closing the changing rooms!

10:23.560 --> 10:24.790
Okay!

10:24.790 --> 10:25.900
Liliel.

10:25.900 --> 10:27.730
Have a photo with me.

10:27.730 --> 10:29.550
Y-Yes!

10:32.010 --> 10:35.900
Is this okay? It looks like Liliel
is being targeted by you.

10:35.900 --> 10:39.100
No, it's more like she just
got accosted by Akito.

10:39.100 --> 10:40.230
I'm done for.

10:40.740 --> 10:42.620
We're closing the changing rooms!

10:42.620 --> 10:44.160
WOMEN'S CHANGING ROOM
Oops, we must hurry.

10:44.160 --> 10:44.830
WOMEN'S CHANGING ROOM

10:45.600 --> 10:48.740
Today was such a blast!

10:48.740 --> 10:50.930
Liliel, can you help me?

10:50.930 --> 10:51.800
Yes.

10:52.780 --> 10:56.260
Would you help me take the tail off?
It fastened there pretty tightly.

10:57.850 --> 11:02.000
Woah, it's stuck right on your tailbone,
not from your costume!

11:02.000 --> 11:04.310
So you're really particular
about that, I see.

11:04.310 --> 11:07.330
Magino, are you still
getting hay fever in May?

11:07.330 --> 11:09.370
That's a lot of masks you have.

11:09.370 --> 11:10.520
Ah, that...

11:11.210 --> 11:13.240
This is to protect me
from the boa fabric.

11:13.630 --> 11:16.240
I've been cosplaying a lot
of furry characters lately.

11:18.710 --> 11:20.530
They're dust masks?

11:20.530 --> 11:22.480
I do worry sometimes...

11:22.480 --> 11:24.790
I wonder if I'm going to die
with so much fur

11:24.790 --> 11:26.460
X-RAY
stuck in my lungs.

11:26.460 --> 11:27.500
X-RAY

11:27.500 --> 11:30.080
But I just cannot stop it.

11:30.080 --> 11:31.340
I know that feeling.

11:31.340 --> 11:34.960
Honestly, I'd love to try
other kinds of cosplay.

11:34.960 --> 11:37.920
But then I realized my closet
was full of Japanese outfits.

11:38.430 --> 11:40.490
That's a little biased.

11:40.490 --> 11:43.930
You only cosplay for characters with
horns or fangs here, right, Bakiko?

11:43.930 --> 11:45.890
You're right.

11:46.270 --> 11:47.850
The other day,

11:47.850 --> 11:52.610
I was on the train home after an event
and felt people were watching me.

11:53.420 --> 11:56.100
Turns out, I forgot that my fangs
were still stuck.

11:57.540 --> 11:58.550
Scary...

11:58.550 --> 11:59.760
You have to be careful.

11:59.760 --> 12:01.950
But you forgot to take your ears off!

12:01.950 --> 12:04.490
Speaking of scary stories...

12:04.490 --> 12:06.290
Were we talking about a scary story?

12:06.660 --> 12:10.330
The other day, after the event,
I was relaxing in my room.

12:12.880 --> 12:16.910
I heard my little brother screaming from
the bathroom, so I went to check on him...

12:18.700 --> 12:22.630
Turns out, I left my wig in the bathtub
after washing it...

12:23.790 --> 12:25.890
That's completely a horror story!

12:26.570 --> 12:32.340
I washed and dried my wig
in the living room, but it fell on the TV.

12:33.190 --> 12:34.650
It was Sadako...

12:35.100 --> 12:35.860
What's this?

12:36.330 --> 12:37.990
You girls seem so excited.

12:37.990 --> 12:40.470
Eh? Who are you?

12:40.470 --> 12:42.420
Aww, it's me, Akito.

12:42.420 --> 12:43.950
Ah, I'm sorry.

12:44.410 --> 12:47.410
She's still cool without cosplay...

12:47.920 --> 12:50.710
Then, I got one scary story for you.

12:50.710 --> 12:53.880
Are we actually telling scary stories now?

12:54.190 --> 12:57.080
I've heard a lot of stories among
cosplayers that they might know

12:57.080 --> 12:59.590
you're cheating on them
if they find a strand from a wig.

13:00.490 --> 13:06.100
In my case, I have a man's jacket hanging
somewhere in my house every day.

13:06.100 --> 13:09.150
My family knows that I cosplay.

13:09.150 --> 13:11.340
But not that I crossplay.

13:11.340 --> 13:14.210
Because they don't ask me
too much about it.

13:15.250 --> 13:17.860
And next thing I know...

13:17.860 --> 13:19.390
MOTHER
Could you at least stop seeing

13:19.390 --> 13:20.980
MOTHER
the one with the leather jacket?

13:20.980 --> 13:21.850
Huh?

13:21.850 --> 13:26.580
They thought that I was dating
seven guys from all different genres.

13:30.480 --> 13:33.880
But, Liliel, you don't seem
to have any worries yet.

13:33.880 --> 13:35.130
Eh?

13:35.530 --> 13:39.340
You have smooth skin,
a cute face, and are stylish.

13:39.910 --> 13:40.800
Don't seduce her!

13:41.500 --> 13:45.510
T-That's not true.
I have a lot of worries...

13:46.140 --> 13:49.610
I'm small and have only breasts,

13:49.610 --> 13:53.460
so my body is not like many people expect.

13:53.980 --> 13:58.170
I can't find clothes that fit my size!

14:00.100 --> 14:01.840
I've heard of that.

14:03.690 --> 14:06.670
There are so many kinds
of cosplay I'd like to try...

14:06.670 --> 14:10.500
But anything that doesn't show
the contours of my body makes me look fat.

14:10.940 --> 14:15.170
That's why...
I will probably only look good...

14:15.170 --> 14:18.150
FIT PERFECTLY TO THE BODY
...in revealing clothes for the rest of my life!

14:18.150 --> 14:20.210
SHOWS OFF EVERY CURVE
But I'm too embarrassed to wear it!

14:21.170 --> 14:22.690
There, there.

14:22.690 --> 14:25.010
But what you wore today
was really cute.

14:25.490 --> 14:26.550
This outfit was chosen by a fashion expert.

14:26.550 --> 14:28.000
A FASHION EXPERT
This outfit was chosen by a fashion expert.

14:28.000 --> 14:28.530
A FASHION EXPERT
What?

14:28.530 --> 14:30.470
A FASHION EXPERT
So I used a cheat today.

14:30.470 --> 14:32.000
A fashion expert, huh?

14:32.000 --> 14:33.980
What fashion expert?

14:33.980 --> 14:36.030
What do you usually wear?

14:36.030 --> 14:37.780
Got any pictures?

14:37.780 --> 14:40.320
I sent it to the expert.

14:46.330 --> 14:49.190
It's not really the right size, right?

14:50.700 --> 14:53.310
It's really lame, no matter the size.

14:53.310 --> 14:54.940
She's so innocent...

14:54.940 --> 14:56.590
...that I can't tell her!

14:56.590 --> 15:00.670
ONE HUNDRED COSPLAY TALES (END)

15:01.010 --> 15:01.880
Ah!

15:03.120 --> 15:05.090
The elf woman...
Her shorts!

15:05.490 --> 15:07.050
I have to give her back her shorts!

15:07.050 --> 15:08.580
The pettipants, huh?

15:08.580 --> 15:10.010
Calm down.

15:10.350 --> 15:11.470
She just left earlier.

15:11.470 --> 15:13.570
Huh? I didn't realize it!

15:13.570 --> 15:16.730
It's hard to tell who's who
without their costume.

15:17.120 --> 15:19.380
But she said you could keep it, right?

15:19.380 --> 15:22.440
But... I'll try looking for her anyway!

15:27.900 --> 15:31.360
Everyone... Thank you so much
for all your help today!

15:31.360 --> 15:32.620
I'm taking my leave now.

15:34.090 --> 15:35.500
Liliel!

15:36.240 --> 15:37.080
Yes?

15:37.490 --> 15:39.040
Let's meet again at Summer Comiket!

15:41.210 --> 15:42.750
Summer Comiket...

15:52.510 --> 15:55.580
She really doesn't have any social media
accounts or business cards.

15:55.580 --> 15:57.620
I wonder if I can meet her again.

16:01.970 --> 16:03.570
Summer Comiket!

16:07.030 --> 16:08.410
LILYSA AMANO

16:08.410 --> 16:09.870
I'M WAITING AT THE STATION
BECAUSE THE VENUE IS CLOSED

16:09.870 --> 16:10.990
GOT IT. I'LL BE THERE SOON.

16:12.150 --> 16:13.410
Senior!

16:15.180 --> 16:16.430
Lilysa!

16:20.330 --> 16:21.880
Sorry for keeping you waiting.

16:22.290 --> 16:25.070
Are you all done?
The train will arrive in 40 minutes.

16:25.070 --> 16:28.460
No. Umm... Just one thing.
Err...

16:29.340 --> 16:33.460
Elf woman! Elf woman, are you here?!

16:33.460 --> 16:35.600
Elf woman!

16:36.160 --> 16:39.280
Are you looking for an elf woman?

16:39.280 --> 16:41.390
Yes. She has long ears...

16:41.390 --> 16:43.760
Ah, but maybe not more.

16:43.760 --> 16:44.690
Long ears?

16:44.690 --> 16:46.250
She said "elf woman."

16:46.250 --> 16:48.450
Are you there, elf woman?

16:48.450 --> 16:50.500
- Elf! Elf woman!

16:50.500 --> 16:51.510
- What...
- Elf! Elf woman!

16:51.510 --> 16:52.550
-...is this?
- Elf woman!

16:52.550 --> 16:53.780
Are you there?

16:53.780 --> 16:55.920
Elf woman!

16:55.920 --> 16:59.250
Don't shout like that!
It's embarrassing!

17:01.730 --> 17:04.640
I'm the 'elf woman.'

17:04.640 --> 17:05.840
She's so pretty!

17:06.640 --> 17:07.500
Are you her partner?

17:07.500 --> 17:08.840
Y-Yes!

17:08.950 --> 17:09.840
E-Elf wom—

17:09.840 --> 17:10.800
Shhh!

17:11.640 --> 17:14.560
I work in an office
not too far from here.

17:14.560 --> 17:16.360
So please shut your mouth.

17:16.360 --> 17:17.770
She doesn't want people to know...

17:18.640 --> 17:21.940
U-Umm... I just wanted to
give these back!

17:24.270 --> 17:27.160
How nice.
You're a kind person.

17:28.010 --> 17:29.630
How did it go with your first cosrom?

17:29.630 --> 17:33.250
Umm, I messed up
in every way possible,

17:33.250 --> 17:34.960
and didn't sell a single copy.

17:34.960 --> 17:36.220
Oh, my.

17:36.220 --> 17:38.140
Well, the first time
is always the hardest.

17:38.140 --> 17:40.590
Mayura didn't sell a single copy
in her first cosrom too.

17:40.590 --> 17:41.870
Seriously?!

17:42.370 --> 17:46.340
Someday, I'll make the best
cosrom just like Ms. Mayura!

17:49.390 --> 17:50.550
Yeah.

17:51.020 --> 17:53.930
Oh, by the way,
I didn't see her today.

17:53.930 --> 17:54.760
Well...

17:55.210 --> 17:58.400
Maybe Mayura won't come
to an event anymore.

18:00.230 --> 18:03.560
What? She's quitting cosplay?!

18:04.640 --> 18:07.770
Well, she's washing her hands of it.

18:07.770 --> 18:10.240
That sounds like she's a criminal...

18:10.770 --> 18:13.570
It's a grown-up thing, you see.

18:13.570 --> 18:16.620
But I'll let her know
that we met today.

18:31.570 --> 18:34.840
Lilysa, about Ms. Mayura...

18:35.810 --> 18:39.060
Yes. She owns that 'Milky Succubus.'

18:40.430 --> 18:43.020
So it's a serious matter...

18:44.070 --> 18:45.990
She can't sell her cosrom,

18:45.990 --> 18:48.640
and the person she admires
is quitting cosplay...

18:48.640 --> 18:51.740
What should I do to comfort her?

18:52.820 --> 18:54.660
Please don't worry about it.

18:55.520 --> 18:59.830
If I keep attending events,
maybe we can meet again someday.

18:59.830 --> 19:03.290
I hope to see everyone
I met today again.

19:09.110 --> 19:12.960
Senior... I'll participate
in the Summer Comiket!

19:13.690 --> 19:15.180
Summer Comiket...

19:15.610 --> 19:20.170
I may have made mistakes today,
but I want to make a better cosrom

19:20.170 --> 19:22.580
to go to the event!

19:28.570 --> 19:29.470
Sure.

19:30.330 --> 19:32.690
Looks like I didn't need to worry.

19:33.460 --> 19:37.990
Well, she didn't give up until
high school in the first place.

19:51.110 --> 19:54.010
Would you help me?

20:00.370 --> 20:03.180
Of course.
Why do you need to ask?

20:04.020 --> 20:07.690
I was able to make my cosrom
and go to the event,

20:07.690 --> 20:09.660
and I can cosplay...

20:09.660 --> 20:11.610
It's all because of you.

20:11.610 --> 20:13.490
That's not true.

20:13.490 --> 20:15.110
It's because you did all your best.

20:15.110 --> 20:16.330
No!

20:17.010 --> 20:19.280
I was able to do all of this
because of you!

20:25.500 --> 20:28.500
Without you, I...

20:31.460 --> 20:32.830
Lilysa?

20:35.210 --> 20:41.180
Lately, I get this strange
feeling when I'm with you...

20:41.780 --> 20:44.390
My heart beats faster
when I'm with you.

20:44.390 --> 20:48.560
And when you help me,
I get this warm feeling in my chest.

20:50.710 --> 20:52.260
Warm feeling in her chest?!

20:52.260 --> 20:56.170
Come to think of it,
I've felt the same way as her!

20:56.170 --> 20:58.250
So Lilysa felt it too?!

20:58.250 --> 20:59.820
Could it be...

21:01.760 --> 21:07.040
I kept wondering what this feeling was.
And finally, I figured it out.

21:08.490 --> 21:10.500
So I thought...

21:11.430 --> 21:13.430
...I must tell this to you.

21:19.680 --> 21:21.120
I...

21:22.780 --> 21:25.220
...really like you.

21:37.140 --> 21:39.030
I really love you...

21:39.550 --> 21:41.280
...as my cosplay partner!

21:41.650 --> 21:42.480
Huh?

21:42.480 --> 21:44.240
Today's event made me realize that.

21:44.730 --> 21:48.300
I'm a lucky girl to have such
an amazing photographer!

21:48.890 --> 21:53.200
I... I see!
As her cosplay partner, I see!

21:53.200 --> 21:55.000
I understand now!

21:56.840 --> 22:00.720
In other words,
this feeling of mine is not love!

22:00.720 --> 22:04.050
I was just jealous as her photographer!

22:04.480 --> 22:08.110
My heart beat faster, it must've been
from my admiration as a cosplayer!

22:08.110 --> 22:11.440
I wondered what I would do
if I fell in love with Senior.

22:11.440 --> 22:14.770
I can't break my promise.

22:14.770 --> 22:16.480
You're making me blush.

22:20.330 --> 22:21.990
Thank goodness.

22:21.990 --> 22:22.740
NO PUNCHLINE
Thank goodness.

22:22.740 --> 22:24.990
NO PUNCHLINE

23:55.040 --> 24:01.120
SENIOR'S SECRET TRAINING?!
